			(property "Description" "L0942 is a calibration-free energy metering chip with built-in clock, suitable for single-phase multi-function energy meter, smart socket, smart home appliances and other applications, with high cost performance. BL0942 integrates 2 high-precision Sigma-Delta ADC, reference voltage, power management and other analog circuit modules, as well as digital signal processing circuits for processing active power, current and voltage RMS and other electrical parameters. BL0942 can measure parameters such as current"
